@startuml
title Figure X. Flowchart of the rule-based assessment scoring and interpretation algorithm of CADS
caption Computerized Assessment of Discernment System (CADS) | RA 9344 & RA 10173 Compliant | MSWDO
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  BorderColor #000000
  ArrowColor #000000
  DiamondBackgroundColor #ffffff
  DiamondBorderColor #000000
}

start

:<b>1. START: Initiate Assessment Session</b>
Social Worker logs in with authorized credentials;

:<b>2. Record or Retrieve CICL Information</b>
• Master profile, case number & minor demographics
• Alleged offense circumstances & intake notes;

repeat
  :<b>3. Administer Instruments & Record Data</b>
  • LMD: 14 open-ended Heinz dilemmas (assign scores s_i ∈ {1..6})
  • IVJ: 54 binary keyed items (c_j ∈ {0, 1})
  • CFC: 35 child functioning observational indicators
  • FFC: 28 family functioning observational indicators;

  backward :Display Validation Errors\nHighlight missing fields / invalid scores;
repeat while (<b>4. Are Required Inputs Complete & Valid?</b>) is (No: Incomplete)
-> Yes: Validated;

repeat
  :<b>5. Compute LMD Moral Development Score</b>
  • Mean: M_LMD = (1/14) * ∑ s_i
  • Scaled Score: S_LMD ∈ [1, 6] via standardized scale table
  • Stage Interpretation: Pre-, Conventional, or Post-conventional;

  :<b>6. Compute IVJ Value Judgment Score</b>
  • Raw Correct Count: R_IVJ = ∑ c_j (0–54 items)
  • Convert via 6-tier interval table to Scaled Score: S_IVJ ∈ [1, 6]
  • Determine qualitative Value Judgment category;

  :<b>7. Compute Combined Discernment Result</b>
  • Combined Mean: D = (S_LMD + S_IVJ) / 2  [1.00 – 6.00]
  • Clinical Discernment Interpretation Level
  <i>(Clinical decision support only; zero automated statutory findings)</i>;

  :<b>8. Compute Independent CFC & FFC Scores</b>
  • Child Functioning Mean: M_CFC = ∑ cred / n_app (35 items)
  • Family Functioning Mean: M_FFC = ∑ cred / n_app (28 items)
  • Division-by-zero safeguard (n_app > 0)
  <i>(Independent profiles; never merged into a composite risk index)</i>;

  :<b>9. Display Scores & Clinical Interpretations</b>
  • Present step-by-step mathematical score breakdown
  • Interactive Assessor Review interface
  • Enter qualitative clinical observations & notes;

  backward :Social Worker Review Adjustment Loop\nRevise qualitative notes or dilemma scoring criteria;
repeat while (<b>10. Is Social Worker Review Complete & Approved?</b>) is (No: Revise)
-> Yes: Approved;

:<b>10b. Persist Records & Generate Assessment Report</b>
• Insert into MySQL assessments & assessment_answers tables via PDO
• Record metadata: assessor_id, reviewed_by_id, reviewed_at
• Append immutable entry to audit_logs
• Generate Initial Assessment Report / Social Case Study PDF;

:<b>11. END: Assessment Processing Complete</b>
Official assessment record archived; reports available for case file;

stop

@enduml
